      "markdown": "---\ntitle: SideStage inventory read-only Reserved column\nslug: sidestage-inventory-reserved-column-2026-08-14\nstatus: shipped\ncreated: 2026-08-14\nupdated: 2026-08-14\n---\n\n## Goal\n\nShow a read-only Reserved quantity in the Inventory tab, sourced from the database reservation aggregate and refreshed through the existing sync system.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- The catalog API exposes reservedQty for every variant.\n- The Inventory grid shows a read-only Reserved column; the event picker does not.\n- Buyer hold, quantity, removal, commit, and expiry paths invalidate catalog.page so the displayed value refreshes promptly.\n- Focused API/web tests and browser verification pass.\n\n## Phase — Implementation\n\n- **P-001** `done` Expose authoritative reservedQty through catalog API/web types, add the Inventory-only read-only Reserved column, and invalidate catalog.page for buyer reservation mutations. importance: high — note: ← WI-38962 completed (done)\n- **P-002** `done` Add focused regression coverage and verify API/web tests, typecheck, and the rendered Inventory UI. blocked-by: P-001 importance: high — note: ← WI-38978 completed (done)\n\n",
