      "markdown": "---\ntitle: SideStage event settings, readiness, and Tests information architecture\nslug: sidestage-event-settings-readiness-ia-2026-08-14\nstatus: shipped\ncreated: 2026-08-14\nupdated: 2026-08-14\n---\n\n## Goal\nMove event-scoped configuration and launch readiness into the event workflow while restoring a clearly named top-level Tests surface for synthetic capability checks.\n\n## Decisions\n- Event settings and readiness are one shared event-scoped panel rendered in the current-event experience and Event Manager after creation.\n- The top-level Tests page retains only synthetic/system capability suites and states their isolation clearly.\n- Remove top-level Settings and Rehearse navigation entries; preserve compatible `?tab=config` and `?tab=test` URLs by resolving both to their new destinations.\n\n## Phase 1 — Information architecture\n- **P-001** `done` Split event-scoped readiness from synthetic/system test suites and establish reusable panel boundaries. importance: high — note: ← WI-38810 completed (done)\n- **P-002** `done` Embed shared event settings/readiness in the current-event surface and Event Manager after event creation. blocked-by: P-001 importance: high — note: Delivered under WI-38810. P-002: shared settings/readiness is mounted in Studio and populated Event Manager. P-003: Settings/Rehearse left main navigation and Tests is synthetic-only. P-004: focused/unit/full-suite/typecheck and prior browser QA are green; browser QA was not rerun per owner instruction.\n- **P-003** `done` Remove Settings/Rehearse from main navigation and restore Tests naming/routing for synthetic suites. blocked-by: P-001 importance: high — note: Delivered under WI-38810. P-002: shared settings/readiness is mounted in Studio and populated Event Manager. P-003: Settings/Rehearse left main navigation and Tests is synthetic-only. P-004: focused/unit/full-suite/typecheck and prior browser QA are green; browser QA was not rerun per owner instruction.\n\n\n\n\n## Phase 2 — Verification\n- **P-004** `done` Add focused tests and run browser verification for both event entry points and Tests. blocked-by: P-002, P-003 importance: high — note: Delivered under WI-38810. P-002: shared settings/readiness is mounted in Studio and populated Event Manager. P-003: Settings/Rehearse left main navigation and Tests is synthetic-only. P-004: focused/unit/full-suite/typecheck and prior browser QA are green; browser QA was not rerun per owner instruction.\n\n",
